      "parameters": {
        "content": "### Qualification agent\nAsks a few questions, checks fit (BANT) and scores the lead. Memory keeps the dialogue per session; the Zoho tool creates the lead with score and comment once the contact details are known.\n\n[Prompt not published in this showcase.]",
        "height": 830,
