    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Website chat: AI qualification agent\n\n### How it works\nA visitor chats on the website. The AI agent asks about the business and the task, checks fit and budget (BANT), scores the lead and, once it has name and contact, **creates the lead in Zoho CRM** with the score and a comment.\n\nDialogue memory is stored in **Postgres**, so the conversation can be reviewed later (workflow 04).\n\n### Setup\n- Connect OpenAI, Postgres and Zoho CRM credentials.\n- Add custom Lead fields `score_AI` and `SCORE_COMMENT` in Zoho.\n- Embed the public chat URL on your site.\n\n[Prompt not published in this showcase.]",
        "height": 579,
        "width": 520,
        "color": 1
      },
      "id": "a3ef0772-0116-46b6-96c1-c40a13edb0bd",
      "name": "Overview",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -610,
        -312
      ]
    }
